{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "ULTRA CORE DIVE",
    "steam_appid": 3664120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664120/extras/dc71a0ccd3ca3ddaca4b22fa278239c7.avif?t=1750411717\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN UNKNOWN THREAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown threat has unearthed from an abandoned planet and millions of bug-like creatures have begun an all out assault on the entire solar system. The situation seemed desperate until a mysterious drill shuttle began charging towards the planet. A new hope perhaps? Descent into the depths of the planet, rescue the trapped soldiers, destroy the source of the threat and don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ULTRA CORE DIVE</strong> is a dark and chaotic arcade twinstick shooter inspired by the masters of the genre. The game features a dark retro inspired pseudo-1bit aesthetic with tons of action on screen. The gameplay is familiar fast-paced twinstick shooter action with a small learning curve, complimented with a tough-as-nails difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and dodge your way through  5 Zones, featuring 50 handcrafted Arenas filled with waves-and-waves of enemies and hazards! Fight huge and brutal BOSSES that fill the screen with bullets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up and equip powerful weapons and abilities with a semi-randomized upgrade system! Be the arcade master and rack up  score multipliers and bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLASHING WARNING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features frequently flashing on screen effects that photosensitive and/or epileptic may find discomforting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewer discretion is adviced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664120/extras/dc71a0ccd3ca3ddaca4b22fa278239c7.avif?t=1750411717\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN UNKNOWN THREAT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown threat has unearthed from an abandoned planet and millions of bug-like creatures have begun an all out assault on the entire solar system. The situation seemed desperate until a mysterious drill shuttle began charging towards the planet. A new hope perhaps? Descent into the depths of the planet, rescue the trapped soldiers, destroy the source of the threat and don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMBRACE THE CHAOS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ULTRA CORE DIVE</strong> is a dark and chaotic arcade twinstick shooter inspired by the masters of the genre. The game features a dark retro inspired pseudo-1bit aesthetic with tons of action on screen. The gameplay is familiar fast-paced twinstick shooter action with a small learning curve, complimented with a tough-as-nails difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot and dodge your way through  5 Zones, featuring 50 handcrafted Arenas filled with waves-and-waves of enemies and hazards! Fight huge and brutal BOSSES that fill the screen with bullets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up and equip powerful weapons and abilities with a semi-randomized upgrade system! Be the arcade master and rack up  score multipliers and bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get consumed by the noise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLASHING WARNING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features frequently flashing on screen effects that photosensitive and/or epileptic may find discomforting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewer discretion is adviced!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "SHOOT AND DODGE your way through the underground arenas in this Dark Chaotic Arcade Twinstick Shooter! Don't get consumed by the noise!",
